# ==============================================================================
# Web3Forms API Configuration for DSA Visualizer
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Obtain your free access key by entering your email at: https://web3forms.com
# 2. Check your email for your Web3Forms Access Key token.
# 3. Paste the key below and rename/copy this file to `.env` (or update your `.env`).
# 4. Restart your Vite dev server (`npm run dev`) after editing.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
